            <div type="edition" xml:lang="lzh" xml:space="preserve">
<ab>
<lb n="1"/>太和廿二年九月十四日佛弟子王
<lb n="2"/>某<choice><sic>戊</sic><corr>戌</corr></choice>為亡父母敬造石像一<choice ana="#jiajie"><orig>區</orig><reg>軀</reg></choice>
<lb n="3" rend="taitou-ping"/>願 皇帝陛下<space dim="vertical" quantity="1" unit="character" subtype="que-zi"/>聖壽無窮
<lb n="4"/>七世父母咸同<g ref="#g-demo-wei">為</g>福<gap reason="lost" quantity="4" unit="character"/>
<lb n="5"/>一切眾生普蒙<gap reason="illegible" quantity="2" unit="character"/>樂
</ab>
            </div>
            <div type="apparatus"/>
            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
                <p>Sample translation: On the fourteenth day of the ninth month of the twenty-second year of Taihe, the lay Buddhist Wang X reverently made one stone image for his deceased parents …</p>
            </div>
            <div type="commentary">
                <p>示範用虛構文本：句式仿北朝造像記常見格式，非真實文物。Fictional specimen following the common formula of Northern-Dynasties votive inscriptions; not a real artifact.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
